{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"جمل أطول ومفردات أقلّ شيوعًا. الكلمات الجديدة في معظمها مشروحة أدناه."},{"btype":"example","text":"I think I should tell Tom that we won't do that anymore.","note":"أظن أنه ينبغي أن أخبر توم أننا لن نقوم بذلك مجددا."},{"btype":"example","text":"If he doesn't go to school, I will not talk to him anymore.","note":"إن لم يذهب إلى المدرسة، لن أكلمه مجددا."},{"btype":"example","text":"I wonder why he asked.","note":"لا أعرف سبب سؤاله."},{"btype":"example","text":"I wonder what happened.","note":"أتساءل ما الذي حدث."},{"btype":"example","text":"I wonder why Tom said that.","note":"أتساءل لماذا قال توم ذلك"},{"btype":"example","text":"I wonder where Tom is and who he's with.","note":"أنا أتساءل أين توم ومع من."},{"btype":"example","text":"Sami called me.","note":"اتّصل سامي بي."},{"btype":"example","text":"Ziri called me.","note":"اتصل بي زيري."},{"btype":"example","text":"Ziri called us.","note":"اتصل بنا زيري."},{"btype":"example","text":"She called you.","note":"اتصلت بك."},{"btype":"example","text":"Mary called us.","note":"اتصلت بنا ماري."},{"btype":"example","text":"They called us.","note":"اتصلوا بنا."}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"en","lang_name":"الإنجليزية","sentences":[{"t":"I think I should tell Tom that we won't do that anymore.","ar":"أظن أنه ينبغي أن أخبر توم أننا لن نقوم بذلك مجددا."},{"t":"If he doesn't go to school, I will not talk to him a